        "last_commit_message": "fix(deps): update Go toolchain and modules with known vulnerabilities (#874)\n\ngovulncheck reported 22 reachable vulnerabilities on main: 18 involve\nthe go1.26.5 standard library (5 of them also golang.org/x/net), the\nothers are in golang.org/x/net, golang.org/x/text, klauspost/compress\nand andybalholm/brotli.\n\nMove the toolchain to go1.26.10 (CI GO_VERSION to match) and update\nx/net v0.62.0, x/text v0.43.0, x/crypto v0.58.0, klauspost/compress\nv1.20.3, andybalholm/brotli v1.2.8 and yuin/goldmark v1.7.17. No source\nchanges. govulncheck now reports only GO-2026-5932 (x/crypto/openpgp,\nreached through an upstream dependency's init).",
